{
  "caveats": [
    "Irrigated area counts cultivation in both seasons and can exceed the physical irrigable land area. Dividing these measures does not give a simple share of land served by irrigation. The table does not provide district detail, water volumes, infrastructure condition, crop yield or a separate rainfed category. The substantial changes in major/minor scheme figures in 2025 are reproduced as printed; this table does not explain whether classification or coverage changed.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
